---
import { assets } from '../data/assets';
---

<section id="about" class="relative bg-sand py-20 md:py-28">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl items-center gap-12 px-5 md:grid-cols-12 md:gap-14 md:px-8">
    <div class="reveal md:col-span-5">
      <picture>
        <source srcset={assets.portraits.about.webp} type="image/webp" />
        <img
          src={assets.portraits.about.jpg}
          alt={assets.portraits.about.alt}
          class="aspect-[4/5] w-full object-cover object-[center_20%]"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
        />
      </picture>
    </div>

    <div class="reveal md:col-span-7 md:pl-4">
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-coral">About</p>
      <h2 class="mt-3 font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-navy md:text-4xl">
        From software craft to data systems
      </h2>
      <div class="mt-6 space-y-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted md:text-lg">
        <p>
          I’m Maleesha Achintha Rodrigo — a Software Engineering graduate from the University of
          Westminster (IIT) pivoting into Data Engineering. I care about dependable pipelines,
          clear data models, and tools people actually use.
        </p>
        <p>
          My experience building repair-shop systems taught me how operational data moves: inventory,
          customer records, messaging triggers, and reporting. That foundation — SQL, databases, and
          automation — is what I bring to data engineering roles.
        </p>
      </div>
      <dl class="mt-8 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
        <div>
          <dt class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-muted">Focus</dt>
          <dd class="mt-1 font-medium text-navy">Data Engineering</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-muted">Based in</dt>
          <dd class="mt-1 font-medium text-navy">Kelaniya, Sri Lanka</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-muted">Education</dt>
          <dd class="mt-1 font-medium text-navy">BEng (Hons) Software Engineering</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-muted">Open to</dt>
          <dd class="mt-1 font-medium text-navy">Full-time Data Engineer roles</dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
